text: ['As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice an artifact or creature.\\nDraw two cards.', "As long as Gaea's Liege isn't attacking, its power and toughness are each equal to the number of Forests you control. As long as Gaea's Liege is attacking, its power and toughness are each equal to the number of Forests defending player controls.\\n{T}: Target land becomes a Forest until Gaea's Liege leaves the battlefield.", 'Enchant land\\nEnchanted land has "{T}, Pay 1 life: Draw a card."', 'Flying, vigilance', 'Other Goblins get +1/+1 and have mountainwalk.', "Other Merfolk get +1/+1 and have islandwalk. (They can't be blocked as long as defending player controls an Island.)", 'Other Zombie creatures have swampwalk. (They can\'t be blocked as long as defending player controls a Swamp.)\\nOther Zombies have "{B}: Regenerate this permanent."', 'Search your library for a card, put that card into your hand, then shuffle.', "The owner of target permanent shuffles it into their library, then reveals the top card of their library. If it's a permanent card, they put it onto the battlefield.", "Whenever you cast a creature spell, choose one —\\n• Create a 1/1 colorless Gnome artifact creature token.\\n• Create a token that's a copy of target artifact token you control.", "{T}: Add one mana of any color in your commander's color identity.\\nSacrifice Commander's Sphere: Draw a card.", "{T}: Add {C}.\\n{4}, {T}: Target creature can't be blocked this turn.", '{T}: Create your choice of a Blood token, a Clue token, or a Food token.\\n{3}, {T}, Sacrifice three artifact tokens with different names: Search your library for an artifact card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle. Activate only as a sorcery.']
flavor: ['"Ooh, a Tide Shaper! This is going straight into my Svyelun deck."', 'Every setback and every triumph had led to this: the moment when she played her last card and knew without a doubt she had won.', 'He stepped inside, then stared in awe. Never before had he imagined such joy and wonder could be contained all in one place.', "If you're looking for it, it's available. The question is how much you're willing to pay.", "No lock of iron is a match for Vraska's will of stone.", 'Not even the cold embrace of death could keep him from his Prerelease events.', 'Rumors quickly spread among thieves about a labyrinth without walls and a prize beyond all measures of worth.', 'The wise always keep an ear open to the whispers of power.', 'With the right tool, nothing is impossible.']
